    "description": "Royal garden, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 982 blocks vs 130 for a garden (most of it is the paving and soil set into the lawn in layer 0). A 21 x 21 formal garden beside the keep, set into the lawn: a stone kerb with box hedges and piers, a gate, broad walks, a fountain and four knot parterres. L2 adds clipped topiary (balls and cones), the fountain's upper bowl and the beds planted in the king's colours; L3 a domed pavilion, four statues of the king's guard, urns, banners and lanterns. Not yet builder-tested: allium, azalea_leaves, cornflower, grass_block, spruce_leaves, stone_brick_slab, stone_brick_wall. Decoration step adds: water.",
